    "body": "OffscreenCanvas is an EventTarget so that WebGL can fire context lost and context restored events at it. \r\n\r\nAlso other people are working on propsal ideas (stay tuned) for dispatching pointer events in Workers to avoid having to go through the main/ui thread for interacting with an OffscreenCanvas.  A likely solution may involve firing pointer events at OffscreenCanvas objects.",
